            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen aneno kombere ma dhum, aka jom'obedo kwoŋ jo obedo joma omiy jo thumo banjin. Aka aneno bende joma ndir ca oŋadi woko ŋuti jo ro ridho yeyo pajo kwoŋ Yesu kodi wac pa Were, ma jok'oyeyo lamo ogwaŋ kosa cal pere, aka jok'oyeyo womwon ranyuth pere ruwaŋ jo kosa i cingi jo. Odwoki rijo kendo kwo pajo to jodhumo gi Kristo oro gana acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jom'otho man je jodoŋ cen ma jok'ocerino cuka oro gana acel orumo. Me a cerino marapena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji je ma jokwanere i cerino marapena me, meno josilwany odoko joleŋ! Ato tho mar'ario kilabedo gi meni kwoŋ jo, to jobino bedo jocway ri Were i wi migam ma jotiyo ri Were gi Kristo munyo jodhumo gine cowo oro gana acel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
