            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.9+DAN.7.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odoko aneno kom moro madwoŋ matar ma dhum kodi ŋat'obed'iye; polo gi piny joringo joeye woko ruwaŋe m'odoko jok'onenere kicutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka aneno joma cango jotho, madongo kodi mathindho, munyo jocungo ruwaŋ kom no, t'iyawo kitawin. To odoko iyawo kitawo man m'obedo kitawo ma kwo. Aka joma cango jotho no othum rijo banjin cungo kwoŋ gima kisi dhano cango otimo i kwo pere, m'ondiki i kitawin no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo wakawaka je jowodho joma cango jotho i jo. Tho kodi piny pa jom'otho bende jowodho jom'onwaŋo ni jo, aka joje othum rijo banjin cungo kwoŋ gima yado jotimo i kwo pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Tho kodi piny pa jom'otho je obol i wakawaka ma mac. Me a tho mar'ario, m'obedo wakawaka ma mac, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka nyatoro je ma k'onwaŋ nyinge i kitawo ma kwo, bende obol i wakawaka ma mac no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
